# Courier mode (run courier): you start at Hector's door, Taqueria La Niebla on Mission (city phase 13's
# interior; it was a taqueria on Valencia before physics phase 31, beside the skate shop's door now), and
# pick up the first order at once (50 s: the sourdough line at Valencia & 17th is a block and a half from
# Mission St). Delivered (here by teleport, 1.7 s in): +1000, and the next order is handed over on the
# spot, its 60 s on top of the 48.3 s left (Dolores Park hammock). Delivered there too: the next one
# (Clarion Alley) adds 45 s.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run courier
cmd 200 teleport -55.3 -305 2.61 356
cmd 600 teleport -235 -230 12.53 356
run 700
expect event courierPickup{leg=0,id=sourdough,seconds=50} within 1..3
expect event courierDeliver{n=1,id=sourdough,points=1000,timeLeft=48.34} within 200..202
expect event courierPickup{leg=1,id=hammock,timeLeft=108.34,bonus=48.34} within 200..202
expect event courierDeliver{n=2,id=hammock} within 600..602
expect event courierPickup{leg=2,id=mission} within 600..602
expect session.courierDone == 2 at 650
expect skater.score == 2000 at 650
expect skater.pos.x < 160 at 2
expect skater.pos.x > 150 at 2
expect no event courierFail
